{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_042040","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"村子北边有一条山溪。那里横着一根带踏板的水管，可以当桥用。听说原本是给抽水蓄能电站引水用的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":138,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不过，要到那里得先破坏收容设施北边的路障。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"听说山溪里有Basilisco，不过可别被它分散注意力，掉下去了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"Basilisco……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"啊，不是我看到的那个怪物。我说的是真正的Basilisco。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"真正的？传说中的蛇王吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"与其说是蛇，不如说是蜥蜴。它会在水面上跑。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"还有这种蜥蜴？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"那可挺值得一看的！不过只有<R=1瓦拉,80cm>左右，也不算很大。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=1瓦拉,80cm>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":82,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"对蜥蜴来说已经算大的了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"跟恐龙一比就小多了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}